      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(4) An offence against this section committed by an individual is\npunishable on conviction by imprisonment for not more than 10\nyears, a fine not more than 10,000 penalty units, or both.\n\nSchedule 2  False accounting\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other\nMeasures) Act 2016\nNo. 15, 2016\n\nPenalty for body corporate",
      "skos:definition": "(4) An offence against this section committed by an individual is\npunishable on conviction by imprisonment for not more than 10\nyears, a fine not more than 10,000 penalty units, or both.\n\nSchedule 2  False accounting\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other\nMeasures) Act 2016\nNo. 15, 2016\n\nPenalty for body corporate",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e1697f92ffed21d8bebde695ae3c4c1129f02d7373db4e2a1460ef80d1025153",
      "skos:note": "Intentional false dealing with accounting documents is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016#sch-2-sec-490-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "490(4) 1  Intentional false dealing with accounting documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(4) An offence against this section committed by an individual is\npunishable on conviction by imprisonment for not more than 10\nyears, a fine not more than 10,000 penalty units, or both.\n\nSchedule 2  False accounting\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other\nMeasures) Act 2016\nNo. 15, 2016\n\nPenalty for body corporate"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490-ss-4-norm",
