      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) An offence against this section committed by an individual is punishable on conviction..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "490(5) 1  Intentional false dealing with accounting documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016#sch-2-sec-490-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(5) An offence against this section committed by a body corporate is\npunishable on conviction by a fine not more than the greatest of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) 100,000 penalty units;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the\nbody corporate, and any body corporate related to the body\ncorporate, have obtained directly or indirectly and that is\nreasonably attributable to the conduct constituting the\noffence—3 times the value of that benefit;\n\n(c) if the court cannot determine the value of that benefit—10%\nof the annual turnover of the body corporate during the\nperiod (the turnover period) of 12 months ending at the end\nof the month in which the conduct constituting the offence\noccurred.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) An offence against this section committed by a body corporate is\npunishable on conviction by a fine not more than the greatest of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) 100,000 penalty units;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the\nbody corporate, and any body corporate related to the body\ncorporate, have obtained directly or indirectly and that is\nreasonably attributable to the conduct constituting the\noffence—3 times the value of that benefit;\n\n(c) if the court cannot determine the value of that benefit—10%\nof the annual turnover of the body corporate during the\nperiod (the turnover period) of 12 months ending at the end\nof the month in which the conduct constituting the offence\noccurred.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "731882c1c6e81fb62b532dcf5b997ab256479c226624a37062410e81804b2880",
      "skos:note": "Offence against section 490(5) committed by a body corporate is punishable."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016#sch-2-sec-490-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "490(5) 1  Intentional false dealing with accounting documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(5) An offence against this section committed by a body corporate is\npunishable on conviction by a fine not more than the greatest of the\nfollowing:\n\n(a) 100,000 penalty units;\n\n(b) if the court can determine the value of the benefit that the\nbody corporate, and any body corporate related to the body\ncorporate, have obtained directly or indirectly and that is\nreasonably attributable to the conduct constituting the\noffence—3 times the value of that benefit;\n\n(c) if the court cannot determine the value of that benefit—10%\nof the annual turnover of the body corporate during the\nperiod (the turnover period) of 12 months ending at the end\nof the month in which the conduct constituting the offence\noccurred."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016-sch-2-sec-490-ss-5-norm",
