      "values:originalText": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\nCommonwealth authority means a body (whether incorporated or\nnot) established for a public purpose by or under a law of the\nCommonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the definition, substitute:\nCommonwealth authority means a body (whether incorporated or\nnot) established for a public purpose by or under a law of the\nCommonwealth.",
