      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-proceeds-of-crime-and-other-measures-act-2016.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of the AusCheck Act 2007 made by this Schedule\napply in relation to the use or disclosure of information after the\ncommencement of this item, whether the information was collected\nbefore or after that commencement.\n\n\n\nNo. 15, 2016\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other\nMeasures) Act 2016\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 26 November 2015\nSenate on 2 February 2016]\n\n(201/15)",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of the AusCheck Act 2007 made by this Schedule\napply in relation to the use or disclosure of information after the\ncommencement of this item, whether the information was collected\nbefore or after that commencement.\n\n\n\nNo. 15, 2016\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Proceeds of Crime and Other\nMeasures) Act 2016\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 26 November 2015\nSenate on 2 February 2016]\n\n(201/15)",
